w):\n  src/pit/pit_durable_store.ts - DurablePointInTimeStore<T>, SQLite, WITHOUT\n  ROWID primary key, UNIQUE (pit_key, as_of_ms), own migration ledger\n  (pit001_market_data_snapshots). GATE3_MIGRATIONS and DESIGNATED_MIGRATION_BLOBS\n  are untouched, so check V-A2-1's exact-four-rows requirement and the Gate A'\n  / P-1 chain are undisturbed.\n\nOperator Drop wiring (new):\n  src/operator_drop/drop_ingestion.ts - OperatorDropIngestionService reuses\n  OperatorDropParser unchanged and resolves identity through the existing\n  series-qualified resolver (buildD114SecurityIdentity /\n  isD114SecurityIdentity). Identity is required, never inferred; no cross-series\n  fallback.\n  src/operator_drop/product_runtime.ts - OperatorDropProductRuntime: drop ->\n  checksum -> identity -> durable write -> point-in-time screening read.\n\nPackage-export admission:\n  ./operator-drop added to the export map, src/operator_drop/package.ts,\n  tsconfig.pit-package.json and the verify-public-package authorized map.\n\nIdempotency key: IngestionPipeline stamps every envelope with time-derived\nidentity (envelopeId, provenance.evaluatedAt, dataVersion, lineageHash), so\ndigesting the whole envelope could never report a duplicate. computeSnapshotDigest\nkeys on the admitted data [pitKey, asOf, payload]; a replay is idempotent while\ndifferent data at the same identity and instant still fails closed.\n\nReconciliation: series-qualified ISIN resolution already existed on main; what was\nabsent was the Operator Drop wiring to it. Durable PIT market-data persistence did\nnot exist and is implemented here rather than assumed.\n\nGovernance: dated superseding REG-06 admission record appended to the IPD\nexecution tracker. The 2026-10-13 DEFERRED disposition and the P-08 records are\nretained verbatim - dated overlays govern historical text.\n\nThree pre-existing exact-contract assertions were updated to the newly authorized\nsurface; none was weakened, deleted or skipped.\n\nVerification: tsc --noEmit clean; npm run build success; npm test 987 tests /\n986 passed / 0 failed / 1 skipped (baseline 941/940/0); npm run\ntest:package-consumer PASS with browser.forbiddenHits: [].\n\nIRR read-only. Production out of scope. O-05 remains OPEN.\n\nCo-authored-by: arena-agent <297053741+arena-agent@users.noreply.github.com>","timestamp":"2026-11-01T10:46:45Z","author":{"name":"ramkivs","email":"302525469+ramkivs@users.noreply.github.com"},"committer":{"name":"ramkivs","email":"302525469+ramkivs@users.noreply.github.com"}},"repository":{"id":1361385667,"node_id":"R_kgDOUSUYww","name":"iips-production-market-data","full_name":"ramkivs/iips-production-market-data","private":false,"owner":{"login":"ramkivs","id":302525469,"node_id":"U_kgDOEggsHQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/302525469?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramkivs","html_url":"https://github.com/ramkivs","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramkivs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramkivs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramkivs/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramkivs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramkivs/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramkivs/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramkivs/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramkivs/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramkivs/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"html_url":"https://github.com/ramkivs/iips-production-market-data","description":null,"fork":false,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ramkivs/iips-production-market-data","forks_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ramkivs/iips-production-market-data/forks","keys_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ramkivs/iips-production-market-data/keys{/key_id}","collaborators_url":"https://api.gith